#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:7248-6
msgid ""
"This plugin is a <b>RSVP (Rapid Serial Visual Presentation)</b> reader. This "
"technique is based on flashing the word(s) at the center of the screen "
"quickly. Your eyes don't need to move when reading like this so the reading "
"speed can be faster. And if you improve the skill, you can perceive more "
"than one word at once, which further increases the reading speed."
msgstr ""

